    "此模型未启用工具调用，无法使用应用搜索服务。请检查模型能力设置，或选择支持内置搜索的模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tool calling is not enabled for this model, so it cannot use the app search service. Check model capabilities or choose a model that supports built-in search."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在设置中配置应用搜索服务，或在助手设置中选择模型内置搜索。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure an app search service in Settings, or select model built-in search in assistant settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前接口暂无法使用模型内置搜索。请改用应用搜索服务，或切换到支持此功能的模型与接口。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Built-in search is unavailable for this API. Use the app search service, or switch to a model and API that support this feature."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用设置中选定的应用搜索服务，需要模型支持工具调用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the app search service selected in Settings. The model must support tool calling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "由模型服务商提供搜索，无需单独配置搜索服务。可用性和费用取决于所选模型及服务商。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search is provided by the model provider without separate search-service setup. Availability and fees depend on the selected model and provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动选择内置搜索或应用搜索服务。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatically choose between built-in search and the app search service."
