    "\n\n这个原生备份不完整，已锁定恢复。请重新选择完整 ZIP，或回到旧 App 重新导出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nThis native backup is incomplete and cannot be restored. Choose a complete ZIP or export again from the old app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\n这是旧版 ZIP 备份。继续后，能找到的图片会恢复；找不到的图片会保留原始文字标记。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nThis is a legacy ZIP backup. Available images will be restored; missing images will retain their original text markers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · 随机先手": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · Random first speaker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 表示只要关键词仍在扫描范围内就保持激活；大于 0 时，命中关键词后会持续到对应的用户轮数。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 keeps entries active while keywords remain in the scan range. Higher values keep them active for that many user turns after a match."
          }
        }
      }
    },
