    "Apple、各 AI 服务商、搜索服务与其他第三方的名称、图标和商标归各自权利人所有。应用内出现它们只用于标识用户可自行配置的兼容服务，不代表合作或背书。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Names, icons, and trademarks of Apple, AI providers, search services, and other third parties belong to their respective owners. They identify compatible services users may configure and do not imply partnership or endorsement."
          }
        }
      }
