    "Mocca 仅在你实际调用对应功能时申请照片、相机、位置、日历、提醒事项或通知权限。位置可能用于天气请求；日历和提醒事项内容及工具结果可能交给当前 AI 服务商完成回答。你可以随时在 iOS 设置中撤回授权。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mocca requests photo, camera, location, calendar, reminder, or notification permission only when you use the relevant feature. Location may be used for weather requests. Calendar or reminder content and tool results may be sent to your AI provider to complete a reply. You can revoke permissions in iOS Settings at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mocca 可以使用通知、实时活动和 iOS 后台任务展示生成进度，但 iOS 会根据电量、温度、内存和网络情况暂停后台工作。重要回复请保持 App 在前台，或稍后回到对话确认最终结果。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mocca can show generation progress through notifications, Live Activities, and iOS background tasks. iOS may pause background work based on battery, temperature, memory, and network conditions. For important replies, keep the app open or return later to confirm the final result."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mocca 备份恢复": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore Mocca backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mocca 当前不提供自建账号、云同步、广告或第三方行为分析 SDK。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mocca currently has no proprietary accounts, cloud sync, advertising, or third-party behavioral analytics SDKs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mocca 是一款为 iPhone 打造的原生 AI 聊天客户端。你可以连接自己的模型服务，创建助手，进行单人对话或多助手群聊。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mocca is a native AI chat client for iPhone. Connect your own model services, create assistants, and have individual or multi-assistant conversations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mocca 是一款由你自行选择模型与服务商的原生 iOS AI 客户端。聊天默认保存在设备上，发送请求时才会把完成回答所需的内容交给你选择的服务。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mocca is a native iOS AI client that lets you choose your models and providers. Chats are stored on your device by default. Content needed for a reply is sent to your chosen service only when you make a request."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mocca 是由用户自行配置服务商的客户端。聊天和设置默认保存在设备上；只有在你主动使用相应功能时，完成请求所需的数据才会发送给你选择的服务。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mocca is a client for services you configure. Chats and settings are stored locally by default. Data needed to fulfill a request is sent to your chosen services only when you actively use the corresponding feature."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mocca 本身不包含 AI 模型。连接你使用的服务商后，就可以开始聊天。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mocca does not include an AI model. Connect your provider to start chatting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mocca 源码采用 GNU Affero General Public License v3.0。许可证允许在遵守相应来源、修改说明和对应源码义务的前提下使用、研究、修改与再分发。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mocca source code is licensed under GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. The license permits use, study, modification, and redistribution subject to its attribution, modification notice, and corresponding source obligations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
