        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "EEE, MMM d, yyyy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“均衡”适合大多数聊天；手动调整任意一项后会切换为“自定义”。“近期记忆”只限制近期记忆块，已启用的长期记忆会独立完整注入，不占用该上限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balanced suits most chats. Changing any value selects Custom. The recent memory limit applies only to its own block; enabled long-term memory is injected in full separately."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“始终显示”和“滚动时显示”使用包含到顶部、上一条用户消息、下一条用户消息和到底部的完整导航面板；“简单”只在离开最新底部后显示一个回到底部箭头，真正到底后自动消失。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always and While Scrolling show the full panel: top, previous user message, next user message, and bottom. Simple shows one return-to-bottom arrow after you leave the latest bottom; it disappears when you reach it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“整理输入”越高，一次能读取的完整聊天证据越多；长期记忆会独立完整注入，不占近期记忆上限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A larger organization input allows more complete chat evidence per update. Long-term memory is injected separately and does not count toward the recent memory limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“整理输入”限制一次整理请求最多装入多少来源证据。调高后更不容易在来源很多或聊天很长时截断，但不会突破“单个聊天证据／摘要”上限，也不会增加最终近期记忆的输出上限。可选的窗口摘要输出同样受单个聊天上限保护。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organization Input limits source evidence in one update request. Increasing it reduces truncation for many or long chats, but does not exceed per-chat evidence limits or increase final recent-memory output limits. Optional chat summaries also obey the per-chat limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“更多”菜单": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "More menu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“立即整理”会使用本页当前设置；返回助手编辑页点右上角“保存”后，自动整理设置才会长期生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organize Now uses the current settings on this page. Tap Save in the assistant editor to keep the automatic organization settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“系统日历”和“提醒事项”是 Apple 的系统数据，与 Mocca 自己的共享日历相互独立。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System Calendar and Reminders use Apple's data, separate from Mocca's shared calendar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“默认”会直接显示思考标题与正文，不添加气泡背景；标题、文字颜色、Markdown 和折叠设置仍然生效。切换回其他样式时，原有气泡颜色与透明度会继续使用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default shows the reasoning title and content without a bubble background. Title and text colors, Markdown, and folding still apply. Other styles retain their saved bubble color and opacity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
