            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close assistant picker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭只会停止自动整理与聊天注入；已经生成的近期记忆和已有长期记忆都会保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disabling stops automatic organization and chat injection. Existing recent and long-term memories are kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后，尚未保存的文件修改会丢失。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Closing will discard unsaved file changes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后，聊天顶部不再显示助手头像与名称。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, the assistant avatar and name are hidden from the top of the chat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭搜索": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭时不会发送任何日历提示词、工具定义或日历内容，也不会增加上下文消耗。你仍然可以手动使用日历。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, no calendar prompts, tool definitions, or calendar content are sent, and no additional context is used. You can still use the calendar manually."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭时不会向模型发送日历提示词、工具或日历内容，手动使用共享日历不受影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, calendar prompts, tools, and content are not sent to models. Manual calendar use is unaffected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭时只发送本轮新选图片；开启后可用滑杆选择当前上下文中最新 1–10 张，最右端“无上限”会发送其中全部未折叠历史图片。本轮新图不占上限，折叠后的旧图不再重发。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, only newly selected images are sent. When on, choose the latest 1–10 images in the current context. Unlimited sends all uncollapsed historical images. New images do not count toward the limit; collapsed images are not resent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭时跟随偏好设置中的全局代理；打开后仅覆盖这个供应商。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, the global proxy in Preferences is used. When on, this overrides it for this provider only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭某一类 Markdown 后，只会把对应消息按纯文本显示，不会修改已经保存的消息内容。": {
