      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restricted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会读取这个助手的所选聊天；不会把其他助手或群聊混进来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads only this assistant's selected chats, excluding other assistants and group chats."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只删除当前显示的这个回复版本，其他版本会保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete only the displayed reply version. Other versions will be kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在这个助手的聊天页面显示，并覆盖默认纯色背景。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shown only in this assistant's chats, overriding the default solid background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只影响之后新发送的用户消息；历史消息与助手消息不会播放。“软弹”和“灵动”只动气泡，“上浮”会让气泡和用户头像一起移动。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies only to new user messages, not history or assistant replies. Soft Bounce and Lively animate the bubble; Float moves both bubble and avatar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只控制侧栏，不影响聊天背景。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affects the sidebar only, not the chat background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有你点按移入后，候选才会进入长期记忆，并从近期记忆移除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Candidates move to long-term memory and leave recent memory only when you choose to move them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只用于这个模型；同名字段会覆盖服务商设置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to this model only. Fields with the same name override provider settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只补回被删除的默认节日，你编辑过的内容会保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only deleted default holidays are restored. Your edited content is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只读": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只调整相邻圆点或编号条目之间的额外留白；不会改变条目内部的换行行距，也不会改变列表与其他段落的距离。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adjust extra space between adjacent bullet or numbered items only. Line spacing within items and spacing around the list remain unchanged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只连接你信任的服务器。工具可能读取或修改远端数据，执行前请检查服务器地址与权限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect only to servers you trust. Tools may read or modify remote data. Check server URLs and permissions before running them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以在“消息操作按钮”设置中重新开启": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable them in Message Action Buttons settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以在日历里逐个编辑或删除。恢复只会补回缺少的默认节日，不会覆盖你的修改。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
