    "打开后，每段思考从生成开始默认折叠，只显示标题与耗时；仍可点击标题随时展开或收起，生成中手动展开后不会在结束时突然折回。关闭后可使用“自动折叠思考过程”控制完成后的折叠。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, each reasoning segment starts collapsed, showing only its title and duration. Tap the title to expand or collapse it. A segment you expand during generation stays open when it finishes. When disabled, automatic collapsing controls what happens after completion."
