      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send a treat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "投喂完全自愿，不影响聊天能力，也不会自动续费。任意档位首次投喂都会解锁 💧 小水滴；各档另会解锁页面标注的永久纪念装扮。所有装扮均为没有功能加成的纯装饰。同一档可以重复投喂，但不会重复增加装扮；每次购买都会由 App Store 单独确认。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Treats are entirely optional, do not affect chat capabilities, and never renew automatically. Your first purchase of any tier unlocks the little water drop 💧. Each tier also unlocks its listed permanent keepsake. All items are cosmetic and provide no functional benefits. Repeat purchases are allowed but do not add duplicate keepsakes. Every purchase is confirmed separately by the App Store."
          }
