    "本地数据会保留到你在 App 内删除、恢复其他备份、清除应用数据或卸载 App。你导出的备份由你选择保存位置并负责保管。删除本地数据不会自动删除第三方服务商已经收到的数据；如需删除，请同时使用对应服务商提供的隐私工具。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local data remains until you delete it in the app, restore another backup, clear app data, or uninstall the app. You choose where to save exported backups and are responsible for keeping them safe. Deleting local data does not delete data already received by third-party services; use their privacy tools to request deletion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
