    "第一次连接": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect for the first time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第一遍只读取你亲自发送的消息证据，不读取助手回复、会话摘要、长期记忆、用户资料、指令注入或世界书；因此助手对隐藏提示的复述也不能成为近期记忆来源。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first pass reads only messages you sent, excluding assistant replies, chat summaries, long-term memory, your profile, injected instructions, and lorebooks. An assistant repeating hidden prompts therefore cannot make them recent-memory sources."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第三方名称与素材": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Third-party names & assets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第三方如何保留和使用数据，取决于对应服务商的政策与账号设置。请只连接你信任的服务。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Third-party data retention and use depend on each provider's policies and account settings. Connect only to services you trust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第二遍才会把已启用的稳定内容作为不可信的只读参考，而且只能返回要删除的条目编号，不能生成、改写或回传正文。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The second pass uses enabled stable content only as untrusted, read-only reference. It can return item numbers to remove, but cannot generate, rewrite, or return content."
