    "编辑": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "编辑、删除、重新生成、从旧消息继续、切换回答版本，或更改长期记忆时，只会先在本机安全标记为待整理，不会立刻调用模型；可以手动完成待整理，或等待原定自动整理时间。普通增量整理只处理有变化的来源；强制重新生成会重新读取候选范围。清除后仍可撤销一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Editing, deleting, regenerating, continuing from an earlier message, switching reply versions, or changing long-term memory safely marks an update as pending locally. It does not call a model immediately. Update manually or wait for the scheduled time. Incremental updates process changed sources only; full regeneration rereads the candidate scope. Clearing can be undone once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "编辑、删除、重新生成、从旧消息继续或切换回答版本，只会取消可能仍在读取旧正文的整理，并标记为“待整理”；不会提前开始新的模型调用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Editing, deleting, regenerating, continuing from an earlier message, or switching versions cancels updates that may still be reading old text and marks them pending. It does not start a new model call early."
          }
        }
      }
    },
