    "请避免在不受信任的设备或网络中填写 API Key，也不要公开聊天备份。你可以通过停用服务、删除凭据、撤回系统权限或删除本地内容停止后续处理。普通隐私问题可通过 App Store 产品页中的“App 支持”联系开发者。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avoid entering API keys on untrusted devices or networks, and do not share chat backups publicly. Disable services, delete credentials, revoke system permissions, or delete local content to stop further processing. For general privacy questions, contact the developer through App Support on the App Store product page."
          }
