      }
    },
    "赞助与纪念装扮": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sponsorship & Keepsakes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "赞助交易由 Apple StoreKit 与 App Store 处理。Mocca 读取经 Apple 验证的交易记录，用于统计投喂次数、恢复已购档位及其永久纪念装扮。Mocca 不接收完整付款卡信息。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sponsorship transactions are processed by Apple StoreKit and the App Store. Mocca reads Apple-verified transactions to count purchases, restore purchased tiers, and unlock their permanent keepsakes. Mocca does not receive full payment card information."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "赞助完全自愿，不影响聊天功能，也不会自动续费。每个档位可以重复投喂；首次购买该档位会留下对应的永久纪念装扮。换机或重装后可在赞助页使用“恢复购买”。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sponsorship is optional, does not affect chat features, and never renews automatically. Each tier can be purchased repeatedly. Your first purchase of a tier unlocks its permanent keepsake. Use Restore Purchases after reinstalling or changing devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
