        }
      }
    },
    "这个助手有聊天内容后，可以在这里排除不想用于整理的窗口。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once this assistant has chats, exclude any you do not want used for memory updates here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些内容会参与提示词组合。加入个人或敏感信息前，请确认你信任将要接收请求的模型服务商。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are included in prompts. Before adding personal or sensitive information, make sure you trust the model provider receiving it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些选项使用 Apple 提供的后台时间、持续处理、通知与实时活动来提升连续性，但系统仍会根据电量和资源决定运行时长。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These options use Apple's background time, continued processing, notifications, and Live Activities to improve continuity. iOS still decides how long tasks run based on battery and available resources."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这份快照已在长期记忆中，并已从近期记忆移除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This snapshot is already in long-term memory and has been removed from recent memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这份文件已被修改或删除。当前输入仍在，请复制需要保留的内容，再关闭并重新打开文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file was modified or deleted. Your input is still here. Copy anything you want to keep, then close and reopen the file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是 iOS 后台限制或服务连接中断的常见结果。重新打开对话，必要时再次发送或重新生成。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This commonly results from iOS background limits or a lost service connection. Reopen the chat and send again or regenerate if needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是一次性的手动快照：选择聊天、生成总结，再立即保存为一条长期记忆；不会替代会自动更新的近期记忆。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a one-time snapshot: choose chats, generate a summary, then save it as a long-term memory. It does not replace automatically updated recent memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是群聊独立开关；不会影响普通聊天，也不会覆盖手动修改过的标题。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This setting applies only to group chats. It does not affect individual chats or overwrite manually edited titles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次粘贴的文字达到 5000 个字符。要转成 TXT 附件吗？也可以继续作为消息文字粘贴。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This text is at least 5,000 characters long. Attach it as a TXT file, or paste it as message text?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这段文字来自旧版，无法可靠判断是你手写的，还是旧整理模型生成的。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This text comes from an older version. We cannot reliably tell whether you wrote it or an earlier model generated it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这段文字还没有完成": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This text is unfinished"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里单独控制点开助手回答“更多”后出现的项目及顺序。“完全删除”只会在同一回答存在多个版本时出现。用户消息操作请长按用户气泡的空白处打开；回复版本选择器只会在产生多个回复时自动出现，不属于可配置操作。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure the items and order in an assistant reply's More menu. Delete Permanently appears only when a reply has multiple versions. Touch and hold empty space in a user bubble for user-message actions. The version picker appears automatically when multiple replies exist and is not a configurable action."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里只自定义助手正在思考时显示的文字；思考结束后会恢复为普通的思考标题。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Customize the text shown while the assistant is thinking. The normal reasoning title returns when thinking finishes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
